program	conformance/V18_discard_nocopy_without_move.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot copy value of type `Box<Int, GlobalAllocator>` which implements NoCopy
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot copy value of type `Box<Int, GlobalAllocator>` which implements NoCopy"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/V18_discard_nocopy_without_move.saw:10:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 10 |     let _ = b"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: use `move` to transfer ownership instead"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
